# Source material, not game content.
#
# .gitignore already keeps this folder out of the repository, but git ignoring
# a folder does not stop Godot importing it: every file here was being packed
# into the .pck, putting 33MB of raw source downloads into the payload players
# have to fetch before the game starts. Nothing in the project references
# assets/incoming/ at all -- the game uses the processed copies in the other
# asset folders.
